# Generated / downloaded data (never committed).
# Anchored to the repo root: the real data lives under PROSPECT_STUDIO_DATA, outside the
# repo, and an unanchored name here would shadow source folders such as
# src/ProspectStudio.Infrastructure/Overture/ (core.ignoreCase makes the match case-blind).
/refdata/
/overture/

